      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. so if the globalist way is causing all that inequality and hurting local jobs, does that mean moving toward more sovereignist policies—like bringing manufacturing back home and focusing on national interests instead of international treaties—is basically the only logical way forward? or is there a real downside to that too?",
